<title>USA: Household plans 7.5-mln shr public offering.</title>
<headline>Household plans 7.5-mln shr public offering.</headline>
<dateline>PROSPECT HEIGHTS, Ill. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Household International Inc said it intends to make a domestic and international public offering of 7.5 million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it has about 98.6 million fully diluted common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Household said proceeds will be used to repay certain short-term borrowings in connection with a previously announced agreement to acquire the capital stock of Transamerica Corp's consumer finance business.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
